                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6c948440-c457-3e23-a922-527193ed8c78",
                        "entry_id": "9f7dd59e-751c-320e-a071-f37660320b88",
                        "glosses": [
                            "истор., воен. в армии Российского государства до 1917 г. и некоторых других государств — воин лёгкой кавалерии, вооружённый пикой, саблей и пистолетом"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dab20caa-2e86-4cef-88e9-68057102cb36",
                                "sense_id": "6c948440-c457-3e23-a922-527193ed8c78",
                                "text": "Уланы с пестрыми значками, // Драгуны с конскими хвостами, // Все промелькнули перед нами, // Все побывали тут."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "da61d1cb-1c48-432c-ad9f-fb839122159b",
                                "sense_id": "6c948440-c457-3e23-a922-527193ed8c78",
                                "text": "Несколько улан верхами провожали нас до русского арьергарда, в виду которого они пожелали счастливого пути и поскакали назад."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4743e5a6-168f-4380-b16d-ed6e78cda4c4",
                                "sense_id": "6c948440-c457-3e23-a922-527193ed8c78",
                                "text": "Семенов развернул полк, и лава улан стала гнать пиками отступающую пехоту, собирая людей, как стадо баранов."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7bdc73a3-0135-4488-bc61-5b203d26dee7",
                        "source_entry_id": "9f7dd59e-751c-320e-a071-f37660320b88",
                        "source_sense_id": "6c948440-c457-3e23-a922-527193ed8c78",
                        "target_lang_word": "lance",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "lance",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6d15ecc9-b649-3dcf-a7f8-4f33df559be0",
                                        "entry_id": "c346c380-b6d3-36de-9660-91255006d88f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A weapon of war, consisting of a long shaft or handle and a steel blade or head; a spear carried by horsemen."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae2b5861-e1c7-4ba4-a17f-2b84f5fc0941",
                                                "sense_id": "6d15ecc9-b649-3dcf-a7f8-4f33df559be0",
                                                "text": "Thy brother’s blood the thirsty earth hath drunk, Broach’d with the steely point of Clifford’s lance[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b981f62-f149-4a64-9506-54f8fb008b34",
                                                "sense_id": "6d15ecc9-b649-3dcf-a7f8-4f33df559be0",
                                                "text": "The head of the lance was commonly of the leaf form, and sometimes approached that of the lozenge; it was very seldom barbed, although this variety, together with the others, appears upon the Bayeux Tapestry."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "40fc3623-e2c5-360c-9ac5-611b43aca462",
                                        "entry_id": "c346c380-b6d3-36de-9660-91255006d88f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A wooden spear, sometimes hollow, used in jousting or tilting, designed to shatter on impact with the opposing knight’s armour."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "713b5835-5055-4624-bd20-7fd3a5e79174",
                                                "sense_id": "40fc3623-e2c5-360c-9ac5-611b43aca462",
                                                "text": "What will you do, good greybeard? Break a lance, And run a-tilt at Death within a chair?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "955359ac-02ae-3062-bacd-64c10c0ba465",
                                        "entry_id": "c346c380-b6d3-36de-9660-91255006d88f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A spear or harpoon used by whalers and fishermen."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fc03438a-7ad4-39c4-9f32-7da6f3a1f253",
                                        "entry_id": "c346c380-b6d3-36de-9660-91255006d88f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A soldier armed with a lance; a lancer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "25afae6a-333c-307d-994b-bb66ef3d6b6b",
                                        "entry_id": "c346c380-b6d3-36de-9660-91255006d88f",
                                        "glosses": [
